# Replace this file with the actual ONNX detection model binary (remove the .README suffix).
# The file must be placed at flutter_app/assets/320n.onnx.
#
# Expected model contract for NudeNetOnnxService:
#   Input  : [1, 3, 320, 320] FLOAT32 (NCHW, normalized to [0.0, 1.0])
#   Output : detection tensors containing bounding boxes in 320x320 model space.
#
# The pipeline rescales detected boxes to the original full-resolution image before
# applying blackout/blur censoring so localization remains accurate.
